    "terrainName": "demo-city",
    "description": "What: Urban fight suite U1 (DESIGN_Urban_Fight_Suite.md §4, user 2026-11-20) - the CAR SHOOTOUT: on demo-city's street at y≈400 (office row front y 410.8, shop row front y 388.4, 22 m wide), 'Blue Squad' (Friend, 6 men: leader, riflemen, grenadiers - mortal) behind three parked cars on the south kerb (x 470-494) and 'Red Squad' (Hostile, the same) behind three on the north kerb (x 540-564), ~72 m apart on the diagonal. No orders: each squad's default SOP fights. Judge (checks.json, the realism rubric §1): both sides fire, each within 10 s of the other's first round; nobody in the fight stands upright in the open 15 s once the shooting starts; no squad knot (all within 3 m) held 10 s; no friendly hits; both sides take losses. Layer-4 review: who peeks from which side of the car, fire from the open, rounds at men or cars, movement (bound / flank along the shop fronts) or a static trade, casualty care, how fast the exchange settles."
  },
